Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: pass only the value to GATT write commands

Write Commands carry a two-byte attribute handle before the value.
Consume it before delivering the value, as in the Write Request path.

--- a/wireless/bluetooth/bt_att.c
+++ b/wireless/bluetooth/bt_att.c
@@ -1659,6 +1659,7 @@
   req = (FAR void *)data->data;
 
   handle = BT_LE162HOST(req->handle);
+  bt_buf_consume(data, sizeof(*req));
 
   wlinfo("handle 0x%04x\n", handle);
 
